# Documentation
docs/
*.md
!requirements.txt

# Code graph — local tooling artifacts, never part of a build.
# ⚠️ `**/` matters: Docker matches with Go's filepath.Match, so a bare
# `graphify-out` would catch the root copy only, and `COPY frontend/ ./` would
# go on shipping frontend/graphify-out into the build stage. The root folder
# alone has reached 4.5 GB, all of it uploaded as build context on every
# `docker build` because this entry was missing.
**/graphify-out

# Docker
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
